    "body": "LGTM with some small suggested inline improvements on areas you're already improving. Notes:\r\n\r\n- This helps with, but doesn't fully fix, https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8364.\r\n- https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11387/commits/feaaa179214d0f0f52ef9511abdb7b02703d8e7d is an improvement, but there are many cases of \"Do thing, and let _x_ be the result\" which would be better as \"Let _x_ be the result of doing thing.\" (But, that seems best as a followup.)\r\n- https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11387/commits/7c82bc25cc1201d50107dbab02d349fb00464979 is a big improvement; thank you\r\n",
